{"id":"3ddc0c5d640e9ab2","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-function-space.md","title":"Function Space","display":"df-function-space — Function Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-function-space","aliases":["58-df-function-space"],"display":"df-function-space — Function Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-function-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-function-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-function-space — Function Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> (set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function-space} \\vdash {}^X Y\\coloneqq \\{f\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times Y):\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function-space} \\vdash {}^X Y\\coloneqq \\{f\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times Y):\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"{}^X Y\">\\({}^X Y\\)</span> 表示从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 的所有函数构成的集合</li>\n<li>也记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y^X\">\\(Y^X\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}(X, Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}(X, Y)\\)</span></li>\n<li>The cardinality identity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|{}^X Y|=|Y|^{|X|}\">\\(|{}^X Y|=|Y|^{|X|}\\)</span> is downstream from the separate definitions of cardinality and cardinal exponentiation; it is not an additional defining clause here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ (set, see [[58-df-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Y$ (set, see [[58-df-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)$ (function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function-space} \\vdash {}^X Y\\coloneqq \\{f\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times Y):\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"{}^X Y","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}(X, Y)","display":false},{"tex":"|{}^X Y|=|Y|^{|X|}","display":false}],"bytes":884,"backlinks":[{"id":"856cf435e7b543a7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e7bde29df78fed04","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"72d50169a31e1436","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"**Constant family**: 若所有 $A_i = A$，则 $\\prod_{i \\in I} A_i = {}^I A$ (see [[58-df-function-space]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-563","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-function-space.md|58-df-function-space]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad","36d7463d215be751"]}